From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: eTran experiment <etran-experiment@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:12:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net/mlx5e: hand off deferred NAPI after IRQ affinity changes

Suppress stale watchdog callbacks atomically with the NAPI ownership transfer. Bound the async ICOSQ retry window per channel and acknowledge the move only from an effective IRQ CPU performing normal NAPI polling.
